ternatively, tap \"Change date\" on GymSub edit. Hmm.\n\nLet's test the edit + date change on the Coffee expense: change date to 11 Nov, save, and see the section heading for 11 November. That would show the weekday formatting for an older date. Then I can revert or delete.\n\nPlan:\n1. Go back to history.\n2. Expand Coffee, tap Edit.\n3. Tap \"Change date\" → date picker. Choose", "truncated": true}
