currence settings. Let me tap Edit on GymSub in history. Also check if changing recurrence (e.g., to Weekly) updates the outside entry.\n\nActually, a likely bug in the changed area: \"Upcoming recurring payments in history: entries there are now built with the basic expense composable.\" The basic expense composable may not show the *date* of the upcoming recurring payment, so upcoming payments outside the period are listed without any date. But that might be intended (they're outside the period).\n\nHmm, another thought: The changed composable might have broken *click behavior* — e.g., tapping the upcoming entry expands then tapping elsewhere. It works.\n\nOr the basic composable might not show the recurrence frequency (Weekly/Monthly), only \"Recurrent expense — 12:00 PM\". The subscription detail (next due date) is missing. Probably by design.\n\nLet me look at the \"Recurrent Expense\" analytics card [31] — tapping it might open a recurring payments list. That could be the \"recurring payments\" area. Earlier we saw \"1 Recurrent Expense\" card with icon. Let me tap it to see. It was at (540,1755) when scrolled. Let me scroll to it and tap.\n\nCurrently we're in Past periods sheet. Close it. Then scroll analytics to the \"1 Recurrent Expense\" card and tap.\n\nClose sheet [0]."}
